  "referenceNumber": "RUS2992",
  "remarks": "\nALTAIR HOLDING SA is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019, on the basis of the following ground:\n \nALTAIR HOLDING SA is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by owning or controlling an entity carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian financial services sector. \n",
